{"id":"39","title":"Buying Clothes and Shoes","goal":"商品、サイズ、在庫を尋ね、着たときや履いたときの合い具合を説明し、購入するかどうかを伝えられるようになります。","language":"ja","study":[{"id":"39-study-0","title":"この章のはじめに","blocks":[{"id":"ja-39-study-0-0","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"服の名前を知っていると、探している商品を伝えやすくなります。"},{"text":"shirt","emphasis":true},{"text":" はシャツ、"},{"text":"T-shirt","emphasis":true},{"text":" はTシャツ、"},{"text":"jacket","emphasis":true},{"text":" はジャケット、"},{"text":"coat","emphasis":true},{"text":" はコート、"},{"text":"dress","emphasis":true},{"text":" はワンピースなど上下が一体になった服、"},{"text":"skirt","emphasis":true},{"text":" はスカート、"},{"text":"shorts","emphasis":true},{"text":" は短いズボン、"},{"text":"jeans","emphasis":true},{"text":" はジーンズ、"},{"text":"pants","emphasis":true},{"text":" はズボン、"},{"text":"sweater","emphasis":true},{"text":" はセーター、"},{"text":"suit","emphasis":true},{"text":" はスーツです。"}],"span":[6,6],"phraseIds":["ch39-p90343288598677","ch39-p224867150841687","ch39-p28767979755415","ch39-p15458066464964","ch39-p142648933443322","ch39-p94152291481249","ch39-p7673784110779","ch39-p173375605610429","ch39-p120718001639692","ch39-p40287195295359","ch39-p13055537602029"]},{"id":"ja-39-study-0-1","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"この章のアメリカ英語で "},{"text":"pants","emphasis":true},{"text":" は、脚を別々の部分で覆う、下半身に着る服を指します。同じ種類の服について "},{"text":"trousers","emphasis":true},{"text":" という言葉も見かけます。靴には、"},{"text":"sneakers","emphasis":true},{"text":"（運動靴）、"},{"text":"boots","emphasis":true},{"text":"（ブーツ）、"},{"text":"sandals","emphasis":true},{"text":"（サンダル）、"},{"text":"dress shoes","emphasis":true},{"text":"（きちんとした服装に合わせる靴）があります。"}],"span":[8,8],"phraseIds":["ch39-p85462979484842","ch39-p251246747925523","ch39-p119524277982620","ch39-p111566008071250","ch39-p31169647730582"]},{"id":"ja-39-study-0-2","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"店員には、具体的な商品を指すか、名前を伝えます。"},{"text":"Do you have this shirt in blue?","emphasis":true},{"text":" は、このシャツの青色があるかを聞きます。"},{"text":"Do you have these shoes in a size nine?","emphasis":true},{"text":" は、この靴のsize nineがあるかを聞きます。"}],"span":[10,10],"phraseIds":["ch39-p194329874824469","ch39-p33437997307238","ch39-p139815667328082","ch39-p107223497822423"]},{"id":"ja-39-study-0-3","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"This","emphasis":true},{"text":" は一枚のシャツなど、単数の物を指します。"},{"text":"these","emphasis":true},{"text":" は一足の靴やズボンなど、英語では複数の形で扱う物にも使います。商品を指定してから、別の色やサイズを求める質問です。"}],"span":[12,12],"phraseIds":[]}],"line":6},{"id":"39-study-1","title":"試着する","blocks":[{"id":"ch39-b2","type":"conversation","turns":[{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Do you have this jacket in a medium?"}],"id":"ch39-line12","person":"Customer","en":"Do you have this jacket in a medium?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Employee","runs":[{"text":"We do. Would you like to try it on?"}],"id":"ch39-line13","person":"Employee","en":"We do. Would you like to try it on?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1490834389.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Yes, please. Where are the fitting rooms?"}],"id":"ch39-line14","person":"Customer","en":"Yes, please. Where are the fitting rooms?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Employee","runs":[{"text":"Just over there."}],"id":"ch39-line15","person":"Employee","en":"Just over there.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1490834389.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Thanks. The sleeves feel a little short. Do you have a large?"}],"id":"ch39-line16","person":"Customer","en":"Thanks. The sleeves feel a little short. Do you have a large?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Employee","runs":[{"text":"I'll check. Would you like the same color?"}],"id":"ch39-line17","person":"Employee","en":"I'll check. Would you like the same color?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1490834389.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Yes, the dark green."}],"id":"ch39-line18","person":"Customer","en":"Yes, the dark green.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"}],"span":[12,18],"art":"ch39-scene-0.svg","theme":"clothes","people":["Customer","Employee"],"caption":"試着する","phraseIds":["ch39-line12","ch39-line13","ch39-line14","ch39-line15","ch39-line16","ch39-line17","ch39-line18"]},{"id":"ja-39-study-1-1","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"客はジャケットのmediumを尋ねています。店員が試着するかを聞くので、客は試着室の場所を確認します。着てみると袖が少し短く感じたため、largeがあるかを聞きます。店員が色を確認すると、同じ濃い緑色を希望すると答えています。"}],"span":[24,24],"phraseIds":[]},{"id":"ja-39-study-1-2","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Try it on","emphasis":true},{"text":" は、実際に身に着けて、見た目や合い具合を確かめることです。"},{"text":"A size up","emphasis":true},{"text":" は、その店のサイズ表示で一つ大きいサイズ、"},{"text":"a size down","emphasis":true},{"text":" は一つ小さいサイズを意味します。分かるなら "},{"text":"medium","emphasis":true},{"text":" や "},{"text":"large","emphasis":true},{"text":" など実際の表示を伝えましょう。すべての商品が同じ寸法感や番号の付け方だとは限りません。"}],"span":[26,26],"phraseIds":["ch39-p254446446996310","ch39-p105640514024859","ch39-p125991705697955"]}],"line":14},{"id":"39-study-2","title":"合い具合を説明する","blocks":[{"id":"ja-39-study-2-0","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"どこがどのように合わないかを伝えると、次に試すものを相談しやすくなります。"}],"span":[30,30],"phraseIds":[]},{"id":"ja-39-study-2-1","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"It's too tight around the shoulders.","emphasis":true},{"text":"：肩の周りが、自分にとって窮屈すぎます。"}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"The pants are too loose at the waist.","emphasis":true},{"text":"：ズボンの腰回りがゆるすぎます。"}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"The sleeves are too long.","emphasis":true},{"text":"：袖が長すぎます。"}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"These shoes feel narrow.","emphasis":true},{"text":"：この靴は幅が狭く感じます。"}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"They fit, but I don't like the color.","emphasis":true},{"text":"：サイズは合いますが、色が好みではありません。"}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"This one fits better.","emphasis":true},{"text":"：こちらのほうが、体や足によりよく合います。"}]}],"span":[32,37],"phraseIds":["ch39-p212441187959602","ch39-p116955557180654","ch39-p80863752915371","ch39-p137381402371223","ch39-p131210981850929","ch39-p237910272556405","ch39-p54951843611689","ch39-p261838736398198"]},{"id":"ja-39-study-2-2","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Too","emphasis":true},{"text":" は、ただ目立つ特徴があるというだけでなく、自分の目的にとって程度が過ぎて問題があることを示します。"},{"text":"A little loose","emphasis":true},{"text":" なら「少しゆるい」という説明で済む場合があります。"},{"text":"too loose","emphasis":true},{"text":" なら「ゆるすぎるので、違う合い具合にしたい」という意味になります。"}],"span":[39,39],"phraseIds":["ch39-p210409054882459"]},{"id":"ch39-b6","type":"conversation","turns":[{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Could I try these in a nine?"}],"id":"ch39-line33","person":"Customer","en":"Could I try these in a nine?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Employee","runs":[{"text":"Sure. How do they feel?"}],"id":"ch39-line34","person":"Employee","en":"Sure. How do they feel?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1490834389.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"They're tight at the front. Do you have a nine and a half?"}],"id":"ch39-line35","person":"Customer","en":"They're tight at the front. Do you have a nine and a half?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Employee","runs":[{"text":"Not in this color, but we have black."}],"id":"ch39-line36","person":"Employee","en":"Not in this color, but we have black.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1490834389.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"I'd rather have blue. Could you check whether another store has them?"}],"id":"ch39-line37","person":"Customer","en":"I'd rather have blue. Could you check whether another store has them?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Employee","runs":[{"text":"I can ask."}],"id":"ch39-line38","person":"Employee","en":"I can ask.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1490834389.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Thanks. If not, I'll keep looking."}],"id":"ch39-line39","person":"Customer","en":"Thanks. If not, I'll keep looking.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"}],"span":[33,39],"art":"ch39-scene-1.svg","theme":"clothes","people":["Customer","Employee"],"caption":"合い具合を説明する","phraseIds":["ch39-line33","ch39-line34","ch39-line35","ch39-line36","ch39-line37","ch39-line38","ch39-line39"]},{"id":"ja-39-study-2-4","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"客は靴をnineで試したいと頼みます。前の部分がきついので、nine and a halfがあるかを聞きます。店員は、今の色にはないが黒ならあると答えます。客は青を希望するため、別の店舗の在庫を確認できるか尋ねます。最後の返事は、なければ引き続き探すという意味です。サイズが合うかと、色が好みかは別々の条件です。"}],"span":[49,49],"phraseIds":[]}],"line":28},{"id":"39-study-3","title":"在庫を確認し、購入の意思を伝える","blocks":[{"id":"ja-39-study-3-0","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Your website shows it in stock","emphasis":true},{"text":" は、店のウェブサイトで在庫ありと表示されていたという、自分が見た情報を伝えます。その後に "},{"text":"Could you check?","emphasis":true},{"text":" と、店員に確認を頼めます。店員が実際の在庫を調べる必要があるかもしれません。"}],"span":[53,53],"phraseIds":["ch39-p273297015244399","ch39-p84897206322441"]},{"id":"ja-39-study-3-1","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Is this on sale?","emphasis":true},{"text":" は、今その商品が値下げ販売の対象かを尋ねます。返品の条件を知ってから買いたいなら、購入前に "},{"text":"What is your return policy?","emphasis":true},{"text":" と聞きます。返品については第40章で詳しく練習します。"}],"span":[55,55],"phraseIds":["ch39-p183610964944453","ch39-p70453452183416"]},{"id":"ja-39-study-3-2","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"決定に合わせて、次のように伝えられます。"}],"span":[57,57],"phraseIds":[]},{"id":"ja-39-study-3-3","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"I'll take this one.","emphasis":true},{"text":"：これを買います。"}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"It doesn't fit the way I want.","emphasis":true},{"text":"：希望する合い具合ではない、と購入を断る理由を説明します。"}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"I'm going to think about it. Thanks for your help.","emphasis":true},{"text":"：少し考えると伝え、店員の手助けにお礼を言います。"}]}],"span":[59,61],"phraseIds":["ch39-p218846951927866","ch39-p170988791467604","ch39-p3144813930413"]},{"id":"ja-39-study-3-4","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"店員に勧められたすべての商品について、良い感想を言う必要はありません。自分の合い具合や希望を正直に伝えてかまいません。"}],"span":[63,63],"phraseIds":[]}],"line":51},{"id":"39-words","title":"言葉と表現","blocks":[{"id":"39-glossary","type":"vocabulary","phraseIds":["ch39-v0","ch39-v1","ch39-v2","ch39-v3"]}]}],"practice":[{"id":"39-practice-0","title":"自分で試す","blocks":[{"id":"ja-39-practice-0-0","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"次の架空の在庫設定を使います："},{"text":"green jacket—medium and large; blue sneakers—size 9 only; black sneakers—9 and 9½","emphasis":true},{"text":"。緑のジャケットはmediumとlarge、青い運動靴はsize 9だけ、黒い運動靴は9と9½があります。一人なら両方の役を読み、相手がいるなら役を交代します。"}],"span":[67,67],"phraseIds":[]},{"id":"ch39-b10","type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"number":1,"runs":[{"text":"ジャケットのmediumを頼みます。袖が短すぎると説明し、もっと大きなサイズを求めてください。"}],"id":"ch39-b10-0"},{"number":2,"runs":[{"text":"青い運動靴の9½を頼みます。店員は黒を提案します。代わりの色を受け入れるか、青を希望していると伝えるかを選んでください。"}],"id":"ch39-b10-1"},{"number":3,"runs":[{"text":"購入を決める前に、返品条件を尋ねます。店員は "},{"text":"I'll show you our written policy.","emphasis":true},{"text":" と、書かれた店の条件を見せると言います。どこで見られるか尋ねるか、お礼を言ってください。"}],"id":"ch39-b10-2"}],"span":[69,71],"phraseIds":[]}],"line":67,"answers":[{"id":"ja-39-practice-0-2","type":"answer","runs":[{"text":"答えの例:","emphasis":true},{"text":" “Do you have this in a medium?” — “Yes.” — “The sleeves are too short. Could I try a large?” / “I'd prefer blue. I'll keep looking, thanks.” / “What's your return policy?” — “I'll show you.” — “Great, thank you.”"}],"span":[73,73],"phraseIds":[]},{"id":"ja-39-practice-0-3","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"最初の例は、試したサイズの問題を伝えてlargeを求めています。二つ目は、別の色を受け入れず、希望の青を探し続けるという返事です。最後は、返品条件を示してもらうことにお礼を言っています。"}],"span":[75,75],"phraseIds":[]},{"id":"ja-39-practice-0-4","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"後で商品と合い具合の問題を変えて練習してください。商品を指定したか、店員が対応できるサイズや別の選択肢を求めたか、購入するかどうかが伝わったかを確認しましょう。"}],"span":[77,77],"phraseIds":[]}]}],"phrases":[{"id":"ch39-p90343288598677","en":"shirt","section":"39-study-0","context":"この章のはじめに","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch39-p90343288598677"},{"id":"ch39-p224867150841687","en":"T-shirt","section":"39-study-0","context":"この章のはじめに","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch39-p224867150841687"},{"art":"word-jacket.svg","id":"ch39-p28767979755415","en":"jacket","section":"39-study-0","context":"この章のはじめに","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch39-p28767979755415"},{"id":"ch39-p15458066464964","en":"coat","section":"39-study-0","context":"この章のはじめに","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch39-p15458066464964"},{"id":"ch39-p142648933443322","en":"dress","section":"39-study-0","context":"この章のはじめに","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch39-p142648933443322"},{"id":"ch39-p94152291481249","en":"skirt","section":"39-study-0","context":"この章のはじめに","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch39-p94152291481249"},{"id":"ch39-p7673784110779","en":"shorts","section":"39-study-0","context":"この章のはじめに","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch39-p7673784110779"},{"id":"ch39-p173375605610429","en":"jeans","section":"39-study-0","context":"この章のはじめに","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch39-p173375605610429"},{"id":"ch39-p120718001639692","en":"pants","section":"39-study-0","context":"この章のはじめに","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch39-p120718001639692"},{"id":"ch39-p40287195295359","en":"sweater","section":"39-study-0","context":"この章のはじめに","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch39-p40287195295359"},{"id":"ch39-p13055537602029","en":"suit","section":"39-study-0","context":"この章のはじめに","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch39-p13055537602029"},{"id":"ch39-p85462979484842","en":"trousers","section":"39-study-0","context":"この章のはじめに","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch39-p85462979484842"},{"id":"ch39-p251246747925523","en":"sneakers","section":"39-study-0","context":"この章のはじめに","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch39-p251246747925523"},{"id":"ch39-p119524277982620","en":"boots","section":"39-study-0","context":"この章のはじめに","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch39-p119524277982620"},{"id":"ch39-p111566008071250","en":"sandals","section":"39-study-0","context":"この章のはじめに","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch39-p111566008071250"},{"id":"ch39-p31169647730582","en":"dress shoes","section":"39-study-0","context":"この章